check_dkim: description  -bytes; +bytes, a record with no p= tag at all;
check_dmarc: description  -invalid_tags}: +invalid_tags, exists}: +or on its np= when the subdomain does not exist in DNS, +REPORT_AUTH_UNCHECKED,
discover_dkim: description  +A *._domainkey wildcard key is one key: the selectors that answer with it are listed once, as selector *, and counted in analysis.wildcardMatches.
